<description>Lot 4, Psu-143364 — OCT P-1616 (Allan V. Inocalla), 152,069 sqm. POSITION v6 (2026-09-20): corner 1 fixed by DOCUMENT MATH — official DENR tie-point table (Camarines Norte), BLBM No. 1 Bo. Batobalane, Paracale (id 52589, PTM-4 471803.27/1574167.76, Luzon/PRS92 14.2348333 N 122.7387250 E; table datum PROVEN Luzon by 0.00 m PTM round-trip; PRS92→WGS84 EPSG transform acc 0.05 m) + title tie line N.60°31'W 3,508.83 m (minutes digit 31' is middle candidate of 01'/31'/51' crease-illegible set; spread ±25 m). Corner 1 = 14.248970 N, 122.711783 E. Est. accuracy ±30-60 m. Supersedes v5 drag-fit (retained as faint outline, 590 m NE). Bearings true north; polygon closure 0.07 m; area check 152,068.9 sqm vs 152,069 titled. PENDING VERIFICATION: bearing minutes digit (runner to read off official plan), GPS pin on physical mojon.</description>
